        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Highly Sought After Dublin 6 location.</li><li> Minutes' walk to Charlemont Luas Stop</li><li> Within walking distance of Ranelagh Village.</li><li> 20-minute walk to Stephen's Green</li><li> G.F.C.H</li><li> Ideal Home or Investment</li><li> Generous Accommodation extending to approximately 99sqm / 1,065sqft</ul>"
